# Build context for the repo-root Dockerfile, which needs ONLY predictions-bot/requirements.txt and the application
# code (main.py, cli.py, the predbot package, tools/ and top-level operator scripts). Everything below is local state,
# credentials or development clutter that must never be baked into an image layer.

# ---- version control / editors / agent tooling (mcp.json holds a deployment credential) ----
.git
.gitignore
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/.kilo
**/.kilocode
**/.claude
**/.cline
**/.codex
**/.cursor

# ---- credentials (the container reads its configuration from the host's environment, never from a file) ----
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/credentials*.json
**/secrets*.json
**/mcp.json

# ---- runtime state: databases (one holds subscriber names), WAL/SHM journals, logs ----
**/data
**/*.db
**/*.db-journal
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.sqlite3-*
**/*.log

# ---- Python environments and caches ----
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov

# ---- scratch / diagnostic output and reports ----
**/_*.txt
**/_*.py
!**/__init__.py
**/_*.db*
**/*_diagnostic*.json
**/*_output.txt
**/*_REPORT.md

# ---- tests are not part of the image (their fixtures include a replay database) ----
predictions-bot/tests

# ---- legacy / alternative deployment files ----
**/Procfile
**/railway.json
**/docker-compose*.yml
